cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  The archived v0.4.0 dataset is available at doi:10.5281/zenodo.23209001.
  This repository includes later corrections not contained in that archive.
  Cite the exact Git revision when referring to corrected data.
title: "Social Engineering Incident Atlas India"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Hamzah"
version: "0.4.1-working-revision"
repository-code: "https://github.com/stuhamz/Social-Engineering-Incident-Atlas-India"
abstract: >-
  A purposively collected public-source corpus of 300 reported social-engineering
  incidents in India, with separate actor-role coding, judicial-proceeding metadata
  and documented limits of attribution and source availability.
keywords:
  - cybercrime
  - social engineering
  - empirical legal research
  - digital evidence
  - attribution
  - India
